  "user_request_original": "Optimize a 24-layer planar dielectric coating on fused silica substrate with air incident medium. Materials: alternating TiO2 (Siefke) and SiO2 (Gao) layers (TiO2 (Siefke) first, then SiO2 (Gao), repeating for 24 total layers). Wavelength bands: maximize reflectance in 450-650 nm, maximize transmittance in 700-1000 nm. Incidence angle: 45 degrees. Polarization: unpolarized (average s and p). Design variables: all 24 layer thicknesses in nanometers. Initialization constraints: layers 1-12 may initialize up to 150 nm, layers 13-23 capped at 120 nm maximum initial thickness. Apply L2 regularization penalty on adjacent layer thickness differences during gradient optimization. Manufacturing constraint: maximum 24 layers (fixed). Use gradient_thickness optimizer with the stated initialization bounds and regularization. Report best_target_score, valid_candidates, tightest_margin, run_status, and thicknesses_nm for all candidates.",
